<p>框架支持在分类下挂载筛选按钮（地区/年份/类型等），UI 自动渲染为横滑按钮，选中后刷新页面。</p>

<h3>方式一：静态定义</h3>

<p style="background:#f5f5f5;padding:8px;border-radius:4px;"><small><font face="monospace">子分类: {<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;"1": [&nbsp;&nbsp;// key = 分类ID<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;{ key: "year", name: "年份", value: [<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;{ n: "全部", v: "" }, { n: "2024", v: "2024" }<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;]},<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;{ key: "area", name: "地区", value: [<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;{ n: "全部", v: "" }, { n: "大陆", v: "大陆" }<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;]}<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;]<br>
}</font></small></p>

<p>每项结构 <font color="#C678DD"><b>{key, name, value:[{n,v}]}</b></font>：key为筛选键（传给方法的字段名），name为显示名，value为选项（n=显示名，v=值，首项"全部"v为空串）。</p>

<h3>方式二：API源自动构建</h3>

<p>分类配置 <font color="#C678DD"><b>cate1</b></font> 为API路径且提供 <font color="#C678DD"><b>filterUrl</b></font> 时，框架请求筛选接口自动生成子分类。响应 data 为数组（按分类顺序）或对象（key为分类ID），自动解析字段：typeList→类型(type)、plotList→剧情(v_class)、districtList→地区(area)、yearList→年份(year)、languageList→语言(lang)，外加固定"排序"(sort)组，选项取 itemText/itemValue。</p>

<h3>方式三：_buildCategories() 自定义分类树</h3>

<p style="background:#f5f5f5;padding:8px;border-radius:4px;"><small><font face="monospace">_buildCategories: function() {<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;return [<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;{ id: "1", name: "电影", children: [], 子分类: [<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;{ key: "year", name: "年份", value: [{n:"全部",v:""},{n:"2024",v:"2024"}] }<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;]},<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;{ id: "2", name: "电视剧", children: [] }<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;];<br>
}</font></small></p>

<h3>方法内读取激活的筛选</h3>

<p style="background:#f5f5f5;padding:8px;border-radius:4px;"><small><font face="monospace">主页: function(page, categoryId) {<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;var filters = getFilterActive(this.host);&nbsp;&nbsp;// 如 {year:"2024", area:"大陆"}<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;var url = this.host + "/list?cate=" + categoryId;<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;if (filters.year) url += "&year=" + filters.year;<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;...<br>
}</font></small></p>

<ul>
<li>运行时全局函数 <font color="#C678DD"><b>getFilterActive(host)</b></font> 返回当前激活的筛选对象</li>
<li><font color="#C678DD"><b>一级(page, cateId, filter)</b></font> 方法通过第三参数直接接收</li>
<li>API源固定筛选键：<font color="#C678DD"><b>type / v_class / area / year / lang / sort</b></font></li>
</ul>

<hr>

<h2>六、核心方法</h2>

<h3>主页(page, categoryId, tabKey)</h3>

<p>返回分类内容列表。别名：<font color="#C678DD"><b>一级</b></font>（额外接收第三参数filter为激活的子分类筛选）、<font color="#C678DD"><b>home</b></font>、<font color="#C678DD"><b>category</b></font>。</p>

<p><b>参数：</b></p>
<ul>
<li><font color="#C678DD"><b>page</b></font> — 页码，从1开始</li>
<li><font color="#C678DD"><b>categoryId</b></font> — 当前分类ID</li>
<li><font color="#C678DD"><b>tabKey</b></font> — 当前 tabs 标签 key（未配置 tabs 时为空串）</li>
</ul>

<h3>推荐()</h3>

<p>返回首页推荐内容列表（轮播+精选）。可选方法，回退规则：</p>
<ul>
<li>未实现推荐但实现主页 → 框架自动调用主页第一页</li>
<li>未实现主页但实现推荐 → 推荐直接作为首页内容</li>
<li>推荐值为 <font color="#C678DD"><b>"js:代码"</b></font> 字符串 → 在独立沙箱执行，用 <font color="#C678DD"><b>VODS</b></font> 数组返回结果</li>
</ul>

<p><b>返回：</b> 数组，每项结构（推荐、主页、一级均可指定 <font color="#C678DD"><b>col_type</b></font>，未指定默认 <font color="#C678DD"><b>movie_3</b></font>）：</p>

<p style="background:#f5f5f5;padding:8px;border-radius:4px;"><small><font face="monospace">{<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;vod_name: "影片名",<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;vod_pic: "图片URL",<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;vod_id: "详情页URL或ID",<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;vod_remarks: "更新信息",<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;col_type: "movie_3"&nbsp;&nbsp;// 可选，卡片样式<br>
}</font></small></p>

<p>或使用标准格式：</p>

<p style="background:#f5f5f5;padding:8px;border-radius:4px;"><small><font face="monospace">{<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;title: "影片名",<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;desc: "更新信息",<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;img: "图片URL",<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;url: "详情页URL",<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;col_type: "movie_3",<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;extra: { name: "影片名" }<br>
}</font></small></p>

<p><b>常用 col_type：</b></p>

<table border="1" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;">
<tr style="background:#f0f0f0;"><td><b>样式</b></td><td><b>说明</b></td></tr>
<tr><td><font color="#C678DD"><b>movie_3 / movie_3_marquee</b></font></td><td>三列海报（默认）/ 标题跑马灯滚动（直播源强制转movie_2）</td></tr>
<tr><td><font color="#C678DD"><b>movie_2</b></font></td><td>两列横图（直播源默认）</td></tr>
<tr><td><font color="#C678DD"><b>movie_1 / movie_1_left_pic</b></font></td><td>单列大图 / 图片在左</td></tr>
<tr><td><font color="#C678DD"><b>movie_1_vertical_pic</b></font></td><td>单列竖图（左图右文）</td></tr>
<tr><td><font color="#C678DD"><b>pic_1 / pic_1_full / pic_1_center</b></font></td><td>大图 / 全宽自适应 / 居中小图</td></tr>
<tr><td><font color="#C678DD"><b>pic_2 / pic_3 / pic_3_square</b></font></td><td>两列矩形 / 三列纯图 / 三列方图</td></tr>
<tr><td><font color="#C678DD"><b>card_pic_1 / card_pic_2</b></font></td><td>轮播卡片（desc设为<font color="#C678DD"><b>"0"</b></font>不模糊）/ 两列卡片</td></tr>
<tr><td><font color="#C678DD"><b>icon_4 / icon_round_4 / icon_2</b></font></td><td>桌面图标类（四列）/ 圆形图标 / 两列左图右文</td></tr>
<tr><td><font color="#C678DD"><b>text_1 ~ text_5</b></font></td><td>一至五列文本（text_2~5支持extra.textAlign）</td></tr>
<tr><td><font color="#C678DD"><b>text_center_1</b></font></td><td>居中文本</td></tr>
<tr><td><font color="#C678DD"><b>long_text / rich_text</b></font></td><td>长文本 / 富文本（extra.textSize、lineSpacing）</td></tr>
<tr><td><font color="#C678DD"><b>flex_button / scroll_button</b></font></td><td>自适应流式按钮 / 横滑按钮（连续push自动聚合）</td></tr>
<tr><td><font color="#C678DD"><b>avatar</b></font></td><td>头像样式（左头像右标题）</td></tr>
<tr><td><font color="#C678DD"><b>input</b></font></td><td>输入框（url执行js，input为输入值）</td></tr>
<tr><td><font color="#C678DD"><b>x5_webview_single</b></font></td><td>X5浏览器组件（一页仅一行，desc设高度如"240&&float"悬停）</td></tr>
<tr><td><font color="#C678DD"><b>line / blank_block</b></font></td><td>分割线 / 空白块</td></tr>
</table>

<p><b>通用 extra：</b><font color="#C678DD"><b>lineVisible:false</b></font> 隐藏底部分界线、<font color="#C678DD"><b>cls:'playlist'</b></font> 连续选集标识（多线路用不同cls如 <font color="#C678DD"><b>playlist r1</b></font>）、<font color="#C678DD"><b>longClick:[{title,js}]</b></font> 自定义长按、<font color="#C678DD"><b>id</b></font> 播放进度记忆键（全局唯一）。</p>

<p><b>轮播写在主页内：</b></p>

<p style="background:#f5f5f5;padding:8px;border-radius:4px;"><small><font face="monospace">主页: function(page, categoryId) {<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;var d = [];<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;if (page == 1) {<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;var html = this.fetchHtml(this.host);<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;var blist = pdfa(html, ".swiper-wrapper&&.swiper-slide");<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;for (var i = 0; i < blist.length; i++) {<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;d.push({<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;title: pdfh(blist[i], "a&&title") || "",<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;img: this.fixUrl(pd(blist[i], "img&&data-original") || ""),<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;url: this.fixUrl(pd(blist[i], "a&&href") || ""),<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;desc: "0",<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;col_type: "card_pic_1"<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;});<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;}<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;}<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;return d;<br>
}</font></small></p>

<h3>搜索(keyword, page)</h3>

<p>返回搜索结果列表，结构与主页相同。</p>

<h3>二级(url)</h3>

<p>返回影片详情。别名：<font color="#C678DD"><b>detail</b></font>。</p>

<p><b>createDetailResult()：</b>全局函数，创建标准详情结果对象，所有字段预置为空，直接赋值即可：</p>

<p style="background:#f5f5f5;padding:8px;border-radius:4px;"><small><font face="monospace">二级: function(url) {<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;var result = createDetailResult();<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;result.img = "海报URL";<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;result.desc = "简介";<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;result.detail1 = "''''导演/主演";<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;result.detail2 = "''''类型/年份";<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;result.line.push("线路1");<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;result.list.push([{ title: "第1集", url: "playUrl" }]);<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;return result;<br>
}</font></small></p>

<p>选集项字段：<font color="#C678DD"><b>title</b></font>（或 <font color="#C678DD"><b>name</b></font>）、<font color="#C678DD"><b>url</b></font>（或 <font color="#C678DD"><b>play_url</b></font>）。</p>

<p><b>框架行为：</b></p>
<ul>
<li><font color="#C678DD"><b>createDetailResult()</b></font> 返回对象没有 title 字段，标题来自列表页的 vod_name/title</li>
<li>二级结果仅在 <font color="#C678DD"><b>line.length &gt; 0</b></font> 时被缓存（30分钟），空结果不缓存，修复代码后可立即生效</li>
<li>选集名以剧集标题开头且总集数&gt;1时，框架自动去除剧名前缀（只有一个选集的除外），无需手动处理</li>
<li>二级执行抛异常时框架返回"失效"线路占位，不会崩溃</li>
</ul>

<p><b>返回对象结构：</b></p>

<p style="background:#f5f5f5;padding:8px;border-radius:4px;"><small><font face="monospace">{<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;img: "海报URL",<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;desc: "简介",<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;detail1: "''''导演/主演信息",<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;detail2: "''''类型/地区/年份",<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;line: ["线路1", "线路2"],<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;list: [<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;[{ title: "第1集", url: "播放URL" }, ...],<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;[{ title: "第1集", url: "播放URL" }, ...]<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;]<br>
}</font></small></p>

<p><b>富文本：</b> 用 <font color="#C678DD"><b>\u2018\u2018\u2019\u2019</b></font>（即''''）包裹：</p>

<p style="background:#f5f5f5;padding:8px;border-radius:4px;"><small><font face="monospace">result.detail1 = "\u2018\u2018\u2019\u2019&lt;font color=\"#006699\"&gt;导演：xxx&lt;/font&gt;";</font></small></p>

<p><b>line 和 list 长度必须一致</b>，不足补空数组。</p>

<p><b>直播源二级：</b> 每个播放源构建为独立线路，每条线路含1个选集：</p>

<p style="background:#f5f5f5;padding:8px;border-radius:4px;"><small><font face="monospace">二级: function(url) {<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;var result = createDetailResult();<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;var resolved = this._resolvePlayUrls(url);<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;if (resolved.urls.length > 0) {<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;for (var i = 0; i < resolved.urls.length; i++) {<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;result.line.push(resolved.names[i] || ("线路" + (i + 1)));<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;result.list.push([{ title: "播放", url: resolved.urls[i] }]);<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;}<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;}<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;return result;<br>
}</font></small></p>

<h3>解析(url, flag)</h3>

<p>将播放页URL解析为可播放地址。flag 为线路名。也可用 <font color="#C678DD"><b>play(flag, id)</b></font> 方法，未实现解析时框架直接调用 play。</p>

<p><b>返回字符串：</b></p>
<ul>
<li>直链：<font color="#C678DD"><b>"video://https://xxx.m3u8"</b></font></li>
<li>嗅探：<font color="#C678DD"><b>"x5Rule://..."</b></font></li>
<li>原链接：<font color="#C678DD"><b>url + "#isVideo=true#"</b></font></li>
<li>网盘标记：<font color="#C678DD"><b>"pan://..."</b></font> 框架透传并按网盘流程打开</li>
<li>失败：空字符串</li>
</ul>

<p><b>返回对象（带headers）：</b>当m3u8/TS分段需要Referer等请求头时，必须返回对象：</p>

<p style="background:#f5f5f5;padding:8px;border-radius:4px;"><small><font face="monospace">解析: function(url) {<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;var playHeaders = { "Referer": this.host + "/", "User-Agent": this.UA };<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;return { urls: [m3u8Url], headers: [playHeaders] };<br>
}</font></small></p>

<p><b>返回对象完整字段：</b></p>

<table border="1" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;">
<tr style="background:#f0f0f0;"><td><b>字段</b></td><td><b>类型</b></td><td><b>说明</b></td></tr>
<tr><td>urls</td><td>string[]</td><td>播放地址数组（.m3u8/.mp4/.flv 自动追加 <font color="#C678DD"><b>#isVideo=true#</b></font>）</td></tr>
<tr><td>names</td><td>string[]</td><td>线路名数组</td></tr>
<tr><td>headers</td><td>object[]</td><td>每线路请求头，传递给播放器用于m3u8和TS分段请求</td></tr>
<tr><td>parse / jx</td><td>1</td><td>设为1时普通http链接按嗅探包装（video://前缀）</td></tr>
<tr><td>danmu</td><td>object</td><td>弹幕配置透传</td></tr>
<tr><td>url</td><td>string</td><td>单URL形式（同 urls:[url]），可搭配 headers/danmu</td></tr>
</table>

<p>系统自动处理：URL匹配<font color="#C678DD"><b>.m3u8/.mp4/.flv</b></font>时添加<font color="#C678DD"><b>#isVideo=true#</b></font>，普通http链接包装为<font color="#C678DD"><b>video://</b></font>前缀，headers传递给播放器。</p>

<h3>内容类型探测（[画] / [音] / [书]）</h3>

<p>框架按规则名自动探测内容类型（与「类型」字段正交，无需配置）：</p>

<table border="1" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;">
<tr style="background:#f0f0f0;"><td><b>名称标记</b></td><td><b>contentType</b></td><td><b>解析输出格式</b></td></tr>
<tr><td>含 <font color="#C678DD"><b>[画]</b></font></td><td>comic</td><td>图片URL → <font color="#C678DD"><b>pics:url1|url2</b></font>；urls数组自动收集图片或 hiker:// 直通；输出至海阔阅读器</td></tr>
<tr><td>含 <font color="#C678DD"><b>[音]</b></font></td><td>audio</td><td>→ <font color="#C678DD"><b>audio://url#isAudio=true#</b></font>；urls数组 → {urls:[audio://...], names}</td></tr>
<tr><td>含 <font color="#C678DD"><b>[书]</b></font></td><td>book</td><td>正文文本 → 阅读模式页面（<font color="#C678DD"><b>#readTheme#</b></font> + rich_text 点击翻页）</td></tr>
<tr><td>其他</td><td>video</td><td>常规 <font color="#C678DD"><b>video://</b></font> / <font color="#C678DD"><b>#isVideo=true#</b></font> 逻辑</td></tr>
</table>

<p>带 [画]/[音]/[书] 的源自动关闭弹幕搜索。</p>

<p><b>[画] 漫画解析写法：</b></p>

<p style="background:#f5f5f5;padding:8px;border-radius:4px;"><small><font face="monospace">解析: function(url) {<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;var html = this.fetchHtml(url);<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;var imgs = html.match(/https?:\/\/[^"'\s]+?\.(?:jpg|png|webp)/gi) || [];<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;return "pics:" + imgs.join("|");&nbsp;&nbsp;// 输出至海阔阅读器<br>
}</font></small></p>

<p><b>[音] 音频解析写法：</b></p>

<p style="background:#f5f5f5;padding:8px;border-radius:4px;"><small><font face="monospace">解析: function(url) {<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;var html = this.fetchHtml(url);<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;var m = html.match(/https?:\/\/[^"'\s]+?\.mp3/i);<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;return m ? (m[0] + "#isMusic=true#") : "";<br>
}</font></small></p>

<p><b>[书] 书籍解析写法：</b></p>

<p style="background:#f5f5f5;padding:8px;border-radius:4px;"><small><font face="monospace">解析: function(url) {<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;var html = this.fetchHtml(url);<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;var m = html.match(/&lt;div id="content"&gt;([\s\S]*?)&lt;\/div&gt;/);<br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;return m ? m[1].replace(/&lt;[^&gt;]+&gt;/g, "\n") : "";&nbsp;&nbsp;// 正文文本，框架自动进阅读模式<br>
}</font></small></p>

<hr>

<h2>七、框架自动注入</h2>

<p>含 <font color="#C678DD"><b>host</b></font> 的规则自动注入以下方法（已自定义则不覆盖）：</p>

<h3>this.fixUrl(url)</h3>

